│                                                          │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                          │
│  AWARDS                                                  │
│                                                          │
│  Most Productive  claude-code · 31 of 61 merges          │
│  Most Reliable    claude-code · 53% of 58 merged         │
│  Most Chaotic     cursor · 36% of its sessions died      │
│  Firefighter      claude-code · 11 red builds saved      │
│  Workhorse        claude-code · 58 of 128 tasks          │
│  Speed Demon      copilot · 7m median run                │
